{"cartConfigs":{"isActive":false},"dynamic_pages":[],"options":{"mobileOnly":false,"versionID":null},"page":[{"id":"sec_2101","type":"section","responsive":{"desktop":{"styles":{"background":"rgba(255,255,255,1)","height":72}},"mobile":{"styles":{"background":"rgba(255,255,255,1)","height":66}}},"children":[{"id":"t_2102","type":"text-block","specials":{"text":"<a href=\"https://www.dijaedadula.com/home\" style=\"color:rgba(26,26,26,1);text-decoration:none\">DIJAE DADULA</a>"},"responsive":{"desktop":{"styles":{"color":"rgba(26,26,26,1)","fontSize":16,"fontWeight":"800","height":24,"left":160,"letterSpacing":"3px","lineHeight":"1.4","top":26,"width":260}},"mobile":{"styles":{"color":"rgba(26,26,26,1)","fontSize":14,"fontWeight":"800","height":22,"left":20,"letterSpacing":"2px","lineHeight":"1.4","top":22}}}},{"id":"b_2103","type":"button","specials":{"text":"Subscribe"},"events":[{"action":"open_link","id":"ev_2104","target":"https://grow.dijaedadula.com/newsletter","targetURL":"_self","type":"click"}],"responsive":{"desktop":{"styles":{"background":"rgba(0,122,102,1)","borderRadius":"8px","color":"rgba(255,255,255,1)","fontSize":15,"fontWeight":"700","height":40,"left":650,"textAlign":"center","top":16}},"mobile":{"styles":{"background":"rgba(0,122,102,1)","borderRadius":"8px","color":"rgba(255,255,255,1)","fontSize":14,"fontWeight":"700","height":38,"left":270,"textAlign":"center","top":14,"width":130}}}},{"id":"n_2105","type":"text-block","specials":{"text":"<a href=\"https://grow.dijaedadula.com/newsletter\" style=\"color:rgba(26,26,26,1);text-decoration:none\">Newsletter</a>"},"responsive":{"desktop":{"styles":{"color":"rgba(26,26,26,1)","fontSize":15,"fontWeight":"500","height":24,"left":532,"lineHeight":"1.4","textAlign":"center","top":26,"width":110}},"mobile":{"config":{"hide":true},"styles":{"color":"rgba(26,26,26,1)","fontSize":14,"height":22,"left":270,"lineHeight":"1.4","textAlign":"center","top":22,"width":130}}}},{"id":"n_2106","type":"text-block","specials":{"text":"<a href=\"https://www.dijaedadula.com/blog\" style=\"color:rgba(26,26,26,1);text-decoration:none\">Blog</a>"},"responsive":{"desktop":{"styles":{"color":"rgba(26,26,26,1)","fontSize":15,"fontWeight":"500","height":24,"left":414,"lineHeight":"1.4","textAlign":"center","top":26,"width":110}},"mobile":{"config":{"hide":true},"styles":{"color":"rgba(26,26,26,1)","fontSize":14,"height":22,"left":270,"lineHeight":"1.4","textAlign":"center","top":22,"width":130}}}},{"id":"l_2107","type":"line","responsive":{"desktop":{"styles":{"borderColor":"rgba(230,232,236,1)","left":0,"top":63,"width":960}},"mobile":{"styles":{"borderColor":"rgba(230,232,236,1)","left":0,"top":60,"width":420}}}}]},{"id":"sec_2108","type":"section","responsive":{"desktop":{"styles":{"background":"rgba(255,255,255,1)","height":8060}},"mobile":{"styles":{"background":"rgba(255,255,255,1)","height":10817}}},"children":[{"id":"t_2109","type":"text-block","specials":{"text":"<a href=\"https://www.dijaedadula.com/home\" style=\"color:rgba(0,122,102,1);text-decoration:underline\">Home</a> · Services"},"responsive":{"desktop":{"styles":{"color":"rgba(120,120,120,1)","fontSize":14,"fontWeight":"400","height":25,"left":160,"lineHeight":"1.5","textAlign":"left","top":64,"width":640}},"mobile":{"styles":{"color":"rgba(120,120,120,1)","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"400","height":24,"left":20,"lineHeight":"1.5","textAlign":"left","top":48,"width":380}}}},{"id":"t_2110","type":"text-block","specials":{"tag":"h1","text":"AI Chatbot Philippines: Done-for-You AI Chatbots for Messenger, Instagram and Websites"},"responsive":{"desktop":{"styles":{"color":"rgba(26,26,26,1)","fontSize":42,"fontWeight":"800","height":204,"left":160,"lineHeight":"1.18","textAlign":"left","top":105,"width":640}},"mobile":{"styles":{"color":"rgba(26,26,26,1)","fontSize":30,"fontWeight":"800","height":147,"left":20,"lineHeight":"1.18","textAlign":"left","top":84,"width":380}}}},{"id":"t_2111","type":"text-block","specials":{"text":"What a done-for-you AI chatbot includes, how the project runs, what drives the cost, and the checks it must pass before it talks to your customers."},"responsive":{"desktop":{"styles":{"color":"rgba(85,85,85,1)","fontSize":21,"fontWeight":"400","height":98,"left":160,"lineHeight":"1.5","textAlign":"left","top":327,"width":640}},"mobile":{"styles":{"color":"rgba(85,85,85,1)","fontSize":18,"fontWeight":"400","height":112,"left":20,"lineHeight":"1.5","textAlign":"left","top":245,"width":380}}}},{"id":"t_2112","type":"text-block","specials":{"text":"By <a href=\"https://www.dijaedadula.com/home\" style=\"color:rgba(0,122,102,1);text-decoration:underline\">Dijae Dadula</a> · November 14, 2026 · 8 min read"},"responsive":{"desktop":{"styles":{"color":"rgba(120,120,120,1)","fontSize":14,"fontWeight":"400","height":25,"left":160,"lineHeight":"1.5","textAlign":"left","top":443,"width":640}},"mobile":{"styles":{"color":"rgba(120,120,120,1)","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"400","height":24,"left":20,"lineHeight":"1.5","textAlign":"left","top":371,"width":380}}}},{"id":"eb_2120","type":"editor-blog","specials":{"html":"<div class='dd-article'>\n<figure class='dd-fig'><div class='dd-shot' style='aspect-ratio:16/9'><img src='https://statics.pancake.vn/web-media-264/ac/be/14/da/5bfc65ee4716bb53b61c74863bf8937b8b6c6bf765fa9b214d0bba04.png' alt='Dark flat illustration of a friendly robot between three chat windows passing a checked clipboard to a support agent wearing a headset' width='1536' height='864' loading='lazy'></div></figure>\n<p>An AI chatbot for a Philippine business is a system that answers customers on Messenger, Instagram and your website in seconds, in English or Taglish, using your own prices, policies and FAQs, and hands the conversation to your team when a person is needed. I design, build and test these systems for businesses in the Philippines and abroad, and I have been building chatbots since 2016.</p>\n<p>This page explains what a done-for-you AI chatbot includes, how the project runs, what drives the cost, and the checks a chatbot must pass before it talks to your customers. If you only need the short version: I start with your sales or service process, not with a tool, and nothing goes live until it passes a written test.</p>\n<div class='dd-tldr'>\n<p class='dd-tldr-title'>What you will get</p>\n<ul>\n<li>A plain definition of an <b>AI chatbot</b> and where it fits in a Philippine business.</li>\n<li>The <b>seven parts</b> of a done-for-you build.</li>\n<li>The <b>six project stages</b>, from diagnosis to weekly review.</li>\n<li>The <b>five cost lines</b> and which one most quotes leave out.</li>\n<li>A <b>launch checklist</b> with acceptance criteria, and questions to ask any provider.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<nav class='dd-toc' aria-label='Table of contents'>\n<p class='dd-toc-title'>On this page</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href='#what'>What an AI chatbot does</a></li>\n<li><a href='#included'>What a build includes</a></li>\n<li><a href='#process'>How the project runs</a></li>\n<li><a href='#cost'>What drives the cost</a></li>\n<li><a href='#launch'>Launch checklist</a></li>\n<li><a href='#choose'>Questions to ask any provider</a></li>\n<li><a href='#faq'>FAQ</a></li>\n</ol>\n</nav>\n<h2 id='what'>1. What does an AI chatbot do for a Philippine business?</h2>\n<p>An AI chatbot reads what the customer typed, finds the answer in the knowledge you gave it, and replies in your tone. Unlike a button-only bot, it copes with one-line questions such as “How much?” and “Still available?”, with mixed English and Filipino, and with questions asked in an order you did not plan for.</p>\n<p>Most Philippine businesses sell through a Facebook Page and Messenger first, so that is usually where the chatbot lives. The same instruction and knowledge can then serve Instagram and a website chat. The work the chatbot takes on is narrow and repetitive on purpose: prices, availability, branches, booking steps, order status and first-level qualification. Refunds, complaints and negotiations stay with a person, with a clear handoff. I explain the handoff rules in <a href='https://www.dijaedadula.com/ai-chatbot-human-handoff'>When Should an AI Chatbot Hand Off to a Human?</a></p>\n<p>I build on the platform that fits the process: Botcake with Pancake for Messenger-first teams, ManyChat for Instagram, GoHighLevel for CRM and booking, and PayMeGPT when the agent needs tools and a larger knowledge base. The comparison is in <a href='https://www.dijaedadula.com/ai-chatbot-platforms-philippines'>Best AI Chatbot and Automation Platforms for Philippine and Southeast Asian Businesses</a>.</p>\n<h2 id='included'>2. What does a done-for-you AI chatbot build include?</h2>\n<p>A chatbot is more than a prompt. These are the seven parts I deliver, and each one exists because skipping it causes a specific failure.</p>\n<div class='dd-table-wrap'>\n<table>\n<thead><tr><th>Part</th><th>What it is</th><th>What goes wrong without it</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>Process map</td><td>How an inquiry becomes a sale or booking today, step by step.</td><td>The bot automates a broken process.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Instruction</td><td>The role, tone, limits and rules the AI follows on every reply.</td><td>It guesses prices and makes promises.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Knowledge base</td><td>Your offers, prices, policies and FAQs, written so the AI can find them.</td><td>Answers are vague or out of date.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Conversation design</td><td>Opening message, qualifying questions and next steps.</td><td>Chats go nowhere.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Human handoff</td><td>The exact moments a person takes over, and how staff are alerted.</td><td>Angry customers are stuck with a bot.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Lead capture</td><td>Name, need and contact details saved to your CRM or sheet.</td><td>Good conversations are never followed up.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Test set</td><td>Real customer questions with the expected answer for each.</td><td>Nobody knows whether it is ready.</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>Every project ends with documentation and training for your team, so you can update prices and promos without calling me. The knowledge base method is in <a href='https://www.dijaedadula.com/rag-ai-agent-business-knowledge'>How to Ground an AI Agent in Your Business Knowledge</a>.</p>\n<h2 id='process'>3. How does the project run?</h2>\n<p>The project runs in six stages. The first two involve no software at all, and they decide most of the result.</p>\n<figure class='dd-fig'>\n<svg class='dk' viewBox='0 0 640 250' role='img' aria-labelledby='sv1t sv1d' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'>\n<title id='sv1t'>Six stages of an AI chatbot project</title>\n<desc id='sv1d'>Six boxes in two rows connected by arrows: Diagnose, Design, Build, then Test, Launch, Review. The Test box is highlighted. A note says nothing goes live until the test set passes.</desc>\n<defs>\n<linearGradient id='sv1g' x1='0' y1='0' x2='0' y2='1'><stop offset='0' stop-color='#1f2224'/><stop offset='1' stop-color='#0a0b0c'/></linearGradient>\n<marker id='sv1a' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z' fill='#8a8f94'/></marker>\n</defs>\n<rect x='0' y='0' width='640' height='250' rx='14' fill='url(#sv1g)'/>\n<text x='24' y='34' class='svg-k'>SIX STAGES, IN ORDER</text>\n<rect x='24' y='52' width='176' height='62' rx='10' fill='#17191b' stroke='#3a3f43'/><text x='38' y='78' class='svg-t'>1 Diagnose</text><text x='38' y='99' class='svg-s'>Goal, process, bottleneck</text>\n<rect x='232' y='52' width='176' height='62' rx='10' fill='#17191b' stroke='#3a3f43'/><text x='246' y='78' class='svg-t'>2 Design</text><text x='246' y='99' class='svg-s'>Flows, handoff, data</text>\n<rect x='440' y='52' width='176' height='62' rx='10' fill='#17191b' stroke='#3a3f43'/><text x='454' y='78' class='svg-t'>3 Build</text><text x='454' y='99' class='svg-s'>Instruction, knowledge</text>\n<rect x='24' y='132' width='176' height='62' rx='10' fill='#10302a' stroke='#3fbfa6' stroke-width='2'/><text x='38' y='158' class='svg-t'>4 Test</text><text x='38' y='179' class='svg-s'>Real questions, pass or fail</text>\n<rect x='232' y='132' width='176' height='62' rx='10' fill='#17191b' stroke='#3a3f43'/><text x='246' y='158' class='svg-t'>5 Launch</text><text x='246' y='179' class='svg-s'>Assist first, then automate</text>\n<rect x='440' y='132' width='176' height='62' rx='10' fill='#17191b' stroke='#3a3f43'/><text x='454' y='158' class='svg-t'>6 Review</text><text x='454' y='179' class='svg-s'>Weekly, from real chats</text>\n<line x1='200' y1='83' x2='228' y2='83' stroke='#8a8f94' stroke-width='1.5' marker-end='url(#sv1a)'/>\n<line x1='408' y1='83' x2='436' y2='83' stroke='#8a8f94' stroke-width='1.5' marker-end='url(#sv1a)'/>\n<line x1='200' y1='163' x2='228' y2='163' stroke='#8a8f94' stroke-width='1.5' marker-end='url(#sv1a)'/>\n<line x1='408' y1='163' x2='436' y2='163' stroke='#8a8f94' stroke-width='1.5' marker-end='url(#sv1a)'/>\n<text x='24' y='228' class='svg-s'>Nothing goes live until the test set passes.</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>Figure 1.</b> The six stages of an AI chatbot project. Testing is the gate between building and launch.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<ol>\n<li><b>Diagnose.</b> We agree on one business goal, write down the current process as it really is, and find where it breaks. The method is in <a href='https://www.dijaedadula.com/dont-automate-chaos'>Don't Automate Chaos</a>.</li>\n<li><b>Design.</b> I map the conversation, the handoff points and the data the chatbot must capture.</li>\n<li><b>Build.</b> I write the instruction, prepare the knowledge base and connect your CRM, calendar or sheet.</li>\n<li><b>Test.</b> I run the test set and fix root causes until it passes. The routine is in <a href='https://www.dijaedadula.com/how-to-test-an-ai-chatbot'>How to Test an AI Chatbot Before It Talks to Your Customers</a>.</li>\n<li><b>Launch.</b> Where the risk is high, the AI drafts and your staff send. Tasks graduate to full automation once they prove reliable.</li>\n<li><b>Review.</b> Real conversations are read every week and the knowledge base is corrected. See <a href='https://www.dijaedadula.com/ai-agent-monitoring-weekly-review'>the weekly review routine</a>.</li>\n</ol>\n<div class='dd-note'><span class='dd-note-label'>Dijae's rule</span><p>If you cannot test it, do not ship it. A chatbot that sounds good in a demo and a chatbot that is safe with your customers are different things, and only a written test tells them apart.</p></div>\n<h2 id='cost'>4. What drives the cost of an AI chatbot in the Philippines?</h2>\n<p>The cost of an AI chatbot has five lines, and the monthly platform plan is rarely the largest. Ask every provider to quote all five, because a cheap build with expensive upkeep is not cheap.</p>\n<figure class='dd-fig'>\n<svg class='dk' viewBox='0 0 640 300' role='img' aria-labelledby='sv2t sv2d' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'>\n<title id='sv2t'>The five cost lines of an AI chatbot</title>\n<desc id='sv2d'>Five rows: Setup is one-time; Platform, AI usage, Maintenance and Channel fees are monthly. Maintenance is highlighted as the line most quotes leave out.</desc>\n<defs><linearGradient id='sv2g' x1='0' y1='0' x2='0' y2='1'><stop offset='0' stop-color='#1f2224'/><stop offset='1' stop-color='#0a0b0c'/></linearGradient></defs>\n<rect x='0' y='0' width='640' height='300' rx='14' fill='url(#sv2g)'/>\n<text x='24' y='34' class='svg-k'>FIVE COST LINES</text>\n<rect x='24' y='50' width='592' height='40' rx='8' fill='#17191b' stroke='#3a3f43'/><text x='38' y='75' class='svg-t'>Setup</text><text x='200' y='75' class='svg-s'>Process, instruction, knowledge, testing</text><text x='528' y='75' class='svg-s'>One-time</text>\n<rect x='24' y='98' width='592' height='40' rx='8' fill='#17191b' stroke='#3a3f43'/><text x='38' y='123' class='svg-t'>Platform</text><text x='200' y='123' class='svg-s'>The chatbot or CRM tool</text><text x='528' y='123' class='svg-s'>Monthly</text>\n<rect x='24' y='146' width='592' height='40' rx='8' fill='#17191b' stroke='#3a3f43'/><text x='38' y='171' class='svg-t'>AI usage</text><text x='200' y='171' class='svg-s'>The model that writes each reply</text><text x='528' y='171' class='svg-s'>Per reply</text>\n<rect x='24' y='194' width='592' height='40' rx='8' fill='#10302a' stroke='#3fbfa6' stroke-width='2'/><text x='38' y='219' class='svg-t'>Maintenance</text><text x='200' y='219' class='svg-s'>Reading chats, updating prices, retesting</text><text x='528' y='219' class='svg-s'>Monthly</text>\n<rect x='24' y='242' width='592' height='40' rx='8' fill='#17191b' stroke='#3a3f43'/><text x='38' y='267' class='svg-t'>Channel fees</text><text x='200' y='267' class='svg-s'>SMS, email or calls, where used</text><text x='528' y='267' class='svg-s'>Per message</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>Figure 2.</b> The five cost lines. Maintenance is the one most quotes leave out.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<p>A focused chatbot for one job, such as answering inquiries and booking calls, costs far less than a full system with CRM, pipeline and follow-up. I scope the project on a free call and give you the five lines in writing. For the per-reply math and a calculator you can fill in yourself, read <a href='https://www.dijaedadula.com/ai-chatbot-cost'>How Much Does an AI Chatbot Cost?</a></p>\n<h2 id='launch'>5. What must a chatbot pass before launch?</h2>\n<p>A chatbot is ready when it meets acceptance criteria you agreed on in advance. This is the checklist I use. Every line is pass or fail.</p>\n<div class='dd-table-wrap'>\n<table>\n<thead><tr><th>Check</th><th>Pass means</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>Accuracy</td><td>Every answer in the test set matches your knowledge base. No invented prices, dates or policies.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Unknown questions</td><td>When the answer is not in the knowledge base, it says so and offers a person.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Handoff</td><td>Complaints, refunds and requests for a person reach staff, with the conversation attached.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Lead capture</td><td>Name, need and contact details land in the CRM or sheet for every qualified chat.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Tone and language</td><td>Replies are short, polite and match the language the customer used.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Privacy</td><td>It asks only for the data it needs and tells customers how it is used.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Guardrails</td><td>It refuses off-topic requests and attempts to change its rules.</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p><b>Success metric:</b> after launch, track first-response time, the share of chats resolved without staff, and qualified leads captured per week. If you collect customer data, read <a href='https://www.dijaedadula.com/data-privacy-act-chatbots-philippines'>the Data Privacy Act guide for chatbots</a>, and for the refusal rules see <a href='https://www.dijaedadula.com/ai-agent-guardrails'>AI agent guardrails</a>.</p>\n<p>An honest limitation: an AI chatbot can still be wrong, and it cannot rescue an unclear offer or a slow sales team. It answers faster and more consistently than a busy inbox, but I do not promise sales, and I will tell you when your process is not ready to automate.</p>\n<h2 id='choose'>6. What should you ask any chatbot provider?</h2>\n<p>Whether you hire me, an agency or a freelancer, ask these questions before you sign anything.</p>\n<ol>\n<li><b>Who owns the accounts?</b> The Page connection, the platform account and the knowledge base should be in your name.</li>\n<li><b>How is it tested?</b> Ask to see the test set and the pass criteria, not a demo.</li>\n<li><b>What does the monthly fee cover?</b> Platform, AI usage, maintenance hours and changes should be listed separately.</li>\n<li><b>When does a person take over?</b> The handoff rules should be written down.</li>\n<li><b>What happens to customer data?</b> Where it is stored, who can see it, and how long it is kept.</li>\n<li><b>Can your team update it?</b> You should be able to change a price without a support ticket.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>If you need one simple bot quickly, a freelancer may be enough. If you need a large team for a long enterprise project, an agency fits. I fit the middle: one senior person who understands the business, designs the whole system, builds the critical parts and stays accountable for the result. My wider services are on <a href='https://www.dijaedadula.com/ai-automation-philippines'>AI Chatbot, AI Agent and Automation Consultant in the Philippines</a>.</p>\n<h2 id='faq'>Frequently asked questions</h2>\n<h3>What is an AI chatbot?</h3>\n<p>An AI chatbot is software that reads a customer's message, finds the answer in the business knowledge it was given, and replies in natural language. It handles questions a button-only bot cannot, and hands off to a person when needed.</p>\n<h3>Can an AI chatbot understand Taglish?</h3>\n<p>Yes. Modern AI models handle Taglish and common Filipino shorthand well when they are given good examples and instructions. It should still be tested on real customer messages before launch.</p>\n<h3>How much does an AI chatbot cost in the Philippines?</h3>\n<p>It depends on five lines: setup, the platform plan, AI usage, maintenance and channel fees. A focused chatbot for one job costs far less than a full system with CRM and follow-up. I scope it on a free call.</p>\n<h3>Which channels can the chatbot work on?</h3>\n<p>Facebook Messenger, Instagram and website chat are the most common. The channel is chosen after the process is mapped, because it depends on where your customers already message you.</p>\n<h3>Do you work with businesses outside the Philippines?</h3>\n<p>Yes. I am based in Bacoor, Cavite, and work remotely with businesses across the Philippines, Southeast Asia, the United States and Canada.</p>\n<div class='dd-cta'>\n<p class='dd-cta-title'>Start with a free blueprint call</p>\n<p><a href='https://www.dijaedadula.com/book'>Book a free AI Automation Blueprint call</a>. We look at where you are losing leads, time or sales, and what system would fix it. Done-for-you projects are delivered through my consultancy, <a href='https://ird.dijaedadula.com'>IRD Digital Marketing Services</a>.</p>\n<p>Prefer to build it yourself first? Start with <a href='https://www.dijaedadula.com/botcake' rel='sponsored nofollow'>Botcake</a> and <a href='https://www.dijaedadula.com/pancake' rel='sponsored nofollow'>Pancake</a>. Pancake coupon <b>CHAMP20</b> gives 20% off all Pancake plans plus 30 days free, for new Pancake customers or a new billing account only. These are affiliate links. For one practical idea every week, <a href='https://grow.dijaedadula.com/newsletter'>join the free newsletter</a>.</p>\n</div>\n<h2>Keep reading</h2>\n<ul class='dd-more'>\n<li><a href='https://www.dijaedadula.com/ai-chatbot-for-small-business'>AI Chatbot for Small Business: What It Does, What It Costs, and How to Choose One</a></li>\n<li><a href='https://www.dijaedadula.com/ai-chatbot-cost'>How Much Does an AI Chatbot Cost?</a></li>\n<li><a href='https://www.dijaedadula.com/how-to-test-an-ai-chatbot'>How to Test an AI Chatbot Before It Talks to Your Customers</a></li>\n<li><a href='https://www.dijaedadula.com/blog'>See all posts on the blog</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n"},"responsive":{"desktop":{"styles":{"height":7503,"left":160,"top":500,"width":640}},"mobile":{"styles":{"height":10345,"left":20,"top":423,"width":380}}}},{"id":"h_css2121","type":"html-box","specials":{"html":"&lt;style&gt;.dd-article ul{list-style:disc outside !important}.dd-article ol{list-style:decimal outside !important}.dd-article li{display:list-item !important}.dd-article ul ul{list-style:circle outside !important}&lt;/style&gt;"},"responsive":{"desktop":{"styles":{"height":1,"left":160,"top":8050,"width":1}},"mobile":{"styles":{"height":1,"left":20,"top":10807,"width":1}}}}]},{"id":"sec_2141","type":"section","responsive":{"desktop":{"styles":{"backgro